    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes logging stream behavior in the SRT logger configuration so error logs are emitted to `stderr` instead of being mixed into `stdout`.\r\n\r\nPreviously, the SRT logger configuration used a single stream handler pointing to `stdout`. That made `ERROR` and exception logs harder to distinguish in shell redirection, process supervision, and log collection setups.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Added a `_MaxLevelFilter` helper in `python/sglang/srt/utils/common.py` to keep log records below `ERROR` on `stdout`\r\n- Updated `python/sglang/srt/utils/common.py` `configure_logger()` to install separate `stdout` and `stderr` handlers\r\n- Ensured existing root handlers are removed and closed before applying the new configuration\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nN/A. This change only affects logging output streams and does not change model outputs.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nN/A. This change only updates logger handler configuration and is not expected to affect inference speed.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\r\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\r\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n- This PR only updates the SRT logger configuration.\r\n- The change has been validated in the NPU environment.\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #30242542907](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30242542907)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #30242542692](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30242542692)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
